  "description": "Seamdang, a small hermitage nestled in the foothills of Jirisan, is filled with the fragrance of pear blossoms.\n\nHayeon, a descendant of a shaman from the southern provinces and the reincarnation of a heavenly maiden, meets Geonwoo, a young man who can intervene in the spirit world through his vajra. Together, they resolve the sorrows and grudges of the world while vanquishing evil spirits.\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8297398)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=832095), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11590455)",
